---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

// Update this date whenever the policy changes.
const lastUpdated = 'November 6, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy – Tabi"
  description="How Tabi collects, uses and protects your information."
>
  <header class="container page-header">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Tabi</a>
  </header>

  <main class="section">
    <article class="container prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-secondary"><strong>Last updated:</strong> {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p class="lead">
        At Tabi, we are committed to protecting your personal information. This 
        policy applies to hellotabi.com and Tabi mobile applications. 
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p> 
        When you register, we collect your email address or phone number. Your 
        medications, dosage, and schedule, including when you mark a dose taken 
        are also collected. Anything optional you add about yourself–age, gender, 
        height, weight, allergies, pharmacy info, and profile photos–are available 
        for us to access.
      </p>
      <p>
        This information is used to run your reminders, track your dose history, 
        and show your progress. Optional fields personalize the app but you are 
        never required to use them.
      </p>

      <h2>Who Sees It</h2>
      <p>
        When you scan a prescription label, the label’s text (not the photo) is 
        sent to a third-party AI service to extract the medication name, dosage, 
        and schedule. Your account and app data are stored with our cloud hosting 
        provider. We do not sell your data or share it with advertisers. 
      </p>

      <h2>Your Controls</h2>
      <p>
        When you scan a prescription label, the label’s text (not the photo) is 
        sent to a third-party AI service to extract the medication name, dosage, 
        and schedule. Your account and app data are stored with our cloud hosting 
        provider. We do not sell your data or share it with advertisers. 
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        Tabi is not intended for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect
        their information. 
      </p>

      <h2>Medical disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        Tabi is a reminder and tracking tool. It does not give medical advice. Always
        follow your doctor's or pharmacist's instructions and check scanned details
        against your medicine label.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If we make important changes, we will update the date at the top of this page and
        let you know in the app.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about your privacy? Email us at
        <a href="mailto:[tabi.harmony@gmail.com]"><strong> tabi.harmony@gmail.com</strong></a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>